"[item]Sliced_avocado[/item] は [machine]cutting_board[/machine] を使って "
"[item]avocado[/item] をスライスして作られます。"

msgid ""
"[item]Sliced_cucumber[/item] is made using a "
"[machine]cutting_board[/machine] to slice [item]cucumber[/item]."
msgstr ""
"[item]Sliced_cucumber[/item] は [machine]cutting_board[/machine] を使用して "
"[item]cucumber[/item] をスライスして作られます。"

msgid ""
"[item]Sliced_salmon[/item] is made using a [machine]cutting_board[/machine] "
"to slice [item]salmon[/item]."
msgstr ""
"[item]Sliced_salmon[/item] は、[machine]cutting_board[/machine] を使って "
"[item]salmon[/item] をスライスして作られます。"

msgid ""
"[item]Sliced_tuna[/item] is made using a [machine]cutting_board[/machine] to"
" slice [item]bluefin_tuna[/item]."
msgstr ""
"[item]Sliced_tuna[/item] は [machine]cutting_board[/machine] を使用して "
"[item]bluefin_tuna[/item] をスライスして作られます。"

msgid ""
"[item]California_roll[/item]s are made with [item]sliced_cucumber[/item], "
"[item]sliced_avocado[/item], [item]imitation_crab[/item], "
"[item]nori_bundle[/item] (seaweed) and [item]cooked_rice[/item] from a "
"[machine]rice_cooker[/machine]. [item]California_roll[/item]s are a western-"
"style sushi containing [item]imitation_crab[/item]."
msgstr ""
"[item]California_roll[/item]は、[item]sliced_cucumber[/item]、[item]sliced_avocado[/item]、[item]imitation_crab[/item]、[item]nori_bundle[/item]（海苔）および[machine]rice_cooker[/machine]で炊いた[item]cooked_rice[/item]で作られます。[item]California_roll[/item]は、[item]imitation_crab[/item]を含む西洋風の寿司です。"

msgid ""
"[item]Cucumber_maki[/item] is made with [item]sliced_cucumber[/item], "
"[item]nori_bundle[/item] (seaweed), and [item]cooked_rice[/item] from a "
"[machine]rice_cooker[/machine]. Maki is a type of sushi roll made by "
"wrapping rice and various fillings in a sheet of nori."
msgstr ""
"[item]Cucumber_maki[/item] は "
"[item]sliced_cucumber[/item]、[item]nori_bundle[/item]（海苔）、そして "
"[machine]rice_cooker[/machine] で炊いた [item]cooked_rice[/item] "
"で作られます。マキは、海苔の一枚でご飯とさまざまな具材を包んで作る寿司の一種です。"

msgid ""
"[item]Deluxe_chirashi_bowl[/item]s are made with [item]sliced_salmon[/item],"
" [item]sliced_tuna[/item], [item]shrimp[/item], "
"[item]sliced_cucumber[/item], [item]tamago[/item] from a "
"[machine]frying_pan[/machine], [item]nori_bundle[/item] (seaweed), and "
"[item]cooked_rice[/item] from a [machine]rice_cooker[/machine]. Chirashi "
"bowls are traditional Japanese rice bowls topped with ingredients typically "
"found in sushi; they're essentially deconstructed sushi."
msgstr ""
"[item]Deluxe_chirashi_bowl[/item]は[item]sliced_salmon[/item]、[item]sliced_tuna[/item]、[item]shrimp[/item]、[item]sliced_cucumber[/item]、[item]tamago[/item]（[machine]frying_pan[/machine]で作られたもの）、[item]nori_bundle[/item]（海苔）、および[item]cooked_rice[/item]（[machine]rice_cooker[/machine]で炊かれたもの）で作られます。チラシ丼は、一般に寿司に使われる具材を載せた伝統的な日本の丼料理で、本質的には分解された寿司です。"

msgid ""
"[item]Dragon_roll[/item]s are made with [item]shrimp_tempura[/item], "
"[item]sliced_cucumber[/item], [item]sliced_avocado[/item], "
"[item]nori_bundle[/item] (seaweed), and [item]cooked_rice[/item] from a "
"[machine]rice_cooker[/machine]. [item]Dragon_roll[/item]s are a western "
"sushi invention topped with avacado to resemble dragon scales."
msgstr ""
"[item]Dragon_roll[/item]は[item]shrimp_tempura[/item]、[item]sliced_cucumber[/item]、[item]sliced_avocado[/item]、[item]nori_bundle[/item]（海苔）、そして[machine]rice_cooker[/machine]で炊かれた[item]cooked_rice[/item]で作られます。[item]Dragon_roll[/item]は西洋で考案された寿司で、アボカドをのせて龍の鱗に見立てています。"

msgid ""
"[item]Rainbow_roll[/item]s are made with [item]sliced_salmon[/item], "
"[item]sliced_tuna[/item], [item]imitation_crab[/item], "
"[item]sliced_cucumber[/item], [item]sliced_avocado[/item], "
"[item]nori_bundle[/item] (seaweed), and [item]cooked_rice[/item] from a "
"[machine]rice_cooker[/machine]. [item]Rainbow_roll[/item]s are a popular "
"western variation on the [item]california_roll[/item] containing mixed "
"colorful fish and vegetables."
msgstr ""
"[item]Rainbow_roll[/item]は[item]sliced_salmon[/item]、[item]sliced_tuna[/item]、[item]imitation_crab[/item]、[item]sliced_cucumber[/item]、[item]sliced_avocado[/item]、[item]nori_bundle[/item]（海苔）、および[machine]rice_cooker[/machine]で炊いた[item]cooked_rice[/item]で作られます。[item]Rainbow_roll[/item]は、色とりどりの魚と野菜を組み合わせた[item]california_roll[/item]の人気のある西洋風バリエーションです。"

msgid ""
"[item]Salmon_maki[/item] is made with [item]sliced_salmon[/item], "
"[item]nori_bundle[/item] (seaweed), and [item]cooked_rice[/item] from a "
"[machine]rice_cooker[/machine]. Maki is a type of sushi roll made by "
"wrapping rice and various fillings in a sheet of nori."
msgstr ""
"[item]Salmon_maki[/item]は、[item]sliced_salmon[/item]、[item]nori_bundle[/item]（海苔）、および[machine]rice_cooker[/machine]で炊いた[item]cooked_rice[/item]を使って作られます。マキは、海苔一枚でご飯と様々な具材を包んで作る巻き寿司の一種です。"

msgid ""
"[item]Salmon_nigiri[/item] is made with [item]sliced_salmon[/item] and "
"[item]cooked_rice[/item] from a [machine]rice_cooker[/machine]. Nigiri is a "
"traditional Japanese dish consisting of a small mound of sushi rice topped "
"with a slice of raw fish."
msgstr ""
"[item]Salmon_nigiri[/item] は [item]sliced_salmon[/item] と "
"[item]cooked_rice[/item]（[machine]rice_cooker[/machine]で炊いた）で作られます。にぎりは、小さな俵状の酢飯の上に切り身の生魚をのせた伝統的な日本料理です。"

msgid ""
"[item]Salmon_temaki[/item] is made with [item]sliced_salmon[/item], "
"[item]sliced_cucumber[/item], [item]nori_bundle[/item] (seaweed), and "
"[item]cooked_rice[/item] from a [machine]rice_cooker[/machine]. Temaki is a "
"sushi variant using a hand-rolled nori cone to contain rice and toppings."
msgstr ""
"[item]Salmon_temaki[/item]は[item]sliced_salmon[/item]、[item]sliced_cucumber[/item]、[item]nori_bundle[/item]（海苔）、および[machine]rice_cooker[/machine]で炊いた[item]cooked_rice[/item]で作られます。手巻きは手で巻いた海苔の円錐に酢飯と具材を詰める寿司の一種です。"

msgid ""
"[item]Spicy_tuna_roll[/item]s are made with [item]sliced_tuna[/item], "
"[item]nori_bundle[/item] (seaweed), [item]cooked_rice[/item] from a "
"[machine]rice_cooker[/machine], and spicy sauce (use your imagination). "
"[item]Spicy_tuna_roll[/item]s are a western type of sushi typically seasoned"
" with sasame siracha sauce."
msgstr ""
"[item]Spicy_tuna_roll[/item]s は "
"[item]sliced_tuna[/item]、[item]nori_bundle[/item]（海苔）、[machine]rice_cooker[/machine]で炊いた[item]cooked_rice[/item]、そしてスパイシーソース（ご想像にお任せください）で作られます。"
" [item]Spicy_tuna_roll[/item]s は洋風の寿司で、通常はゴマ入りシラチャーソースで味付けされます。"

msgid ""
"[item]Tamago_nigiri[/item] is made with [item]tamago[/item] (egg omelette) "
"from a [machine]frying_pan[/machine] and [item]cooked_rice[/item] from a "
"[machine]rice_cooker[/machine]. [item]Tamago_nigiri[/item] is a traditional "
"Japanese dish consisting of a small mound of sushi rice topped with a slice "
"of tamago."
msgstr ""
"玉子握りのレシピ情報\n"
"\n"
"[item]Tamago_nigiri[/item] は、[machine]frying_pan[/machine] で作られた [item]tamago[/item]（卵焼き）と、[machine]rice_cooker[/machine] で作られた [item]cooked_rice[/item] で作られます。[item]Tamago_nigiri[/item] は、小さく握った寿司飯の上に卵焼きの一切れをのせた伝統的な日本料理です。"

msgid ""
"[item]Tuna_temaki[/item] is made with [item]sliced_tuna[/item], "
"[item]sliced_cucumber[/item], [item]nori_bundle[/item] (seaweed), and "
"[item]cooked_rice[/item] from a [machine]rice_cooker[/machine]. Temaki is a "
"sushi variant using a hand-rolled nori cone to contain rice and toppings."
msgstr ""
"[item]Tuna_temaki[/item] "
"は、[item]sliced_tuna[/item]、[item]sliced_cucumber[/item]、[item]nori_bundle[/item]（海苔）および"
" [machine]rice_cooker[/machine] で炊いた [item]cooked_rice[/item] "
"で作られます。手巻きは、手で巻いた海苔の円錐（コーン）でご飯と具材を包む寿司の一種です。"

msgid ""
"[item]Tamago[/item] is made with an [item]egg[/item] using a "
"[machine]frying_pan[/machine]. [item]Tamago[/item] is a traditional Japanese"
" omelette made by rolling together layers of fried eggs."
msgstr ""
"[item]Tamago[/item] は [item]egg[/item] を使って [machine]frying_pan[/machine] "
"で作られます。 [item]Tamago[/item] は、焼いた卵を何層も巻き重ねて作る伝統的な日本の卵焼きです。"

msgid ""
"[item]Shrimp_tempura[/item] is made with [item]shrimp[/item] using a "
